Z||000000||JayLT1||12-28-2001||01:11 AM||||im driving on the freeway when i see a red acura with euro lights so i decide what the hell, lets have some fun, so i get next to him and we start to swerve in and out of lanes.  Not wanting to crash i pulled him over and asked him if he would race.  He said sure so we went to a abandoned street and my friend got out and played flag man.  Before this though i asked him what he had, he replied, intake, exhaust, short shifter, racing clutch, racing flywheel, MSd ignition, and racing tires in the front.  I smirked when he asked me what i had and said a tune up and a air filter.  He smiled like he thought he was going to kick my A$$.  So we lined up and 1 - 2 - 3 skirt skirt skirt i launched on him and took him by a car , 2nd gear(skirt) and i kept on pulling, third gear i was keeping my lead and by 100MPH i had 3 cars on him.  So i hit my blinkers and bust a U so i can pick up my frind, and then he says i got a bad lauch, so once again. 1st 2nd 3rd but after i won this time he didnt stop and turn around he went straight. LOL . And just so all you guys know, he wasnt a shitty driver, my car was just faster and it was great beating him too.  Long live the Fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>J<P>------------------<BR>86 Black GT (95LT1 on the way)||||reg||1
